      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "64",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Singa okingure eiguru osongoke, amabanga gakubone gatengete, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nk'okwo omuliro gwokya ekishaka, gukachumba amaizi gakatabura. Singa oije oyoleke ababisha bawe obushobora bwawe, n'amahanga gakubone gajugumbe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haliho orwo waizire, amabanga gakakubona gakatengeta, okakora eby'okutangaza ebyo twabaire tutetegeire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwema eirai taliho arakuboine anga kuhulira Ruhanga ondijo atali iwe. Iwe ni iwe okolera abakwesiga ebyab'ebi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogonza omuntu ashemelerwa kukora eby'obugorogoki, ogonza abakwijuka nibekomya entwaza zawe. Leba, tukafakara, wanigara; tufakaire orurai, turarokoka? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichwena nitushusha omuhagare, n'ebikorwa byaitu byona eby'obugorogoki nibishusha ekijwaro ekitokoire. Ichwena twayoma nk'ekibabi, entambara zaitu zatunaganaga nk'omuyaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ow'okukushaba taliho n'omoi, taliho wa kukugoba k'omujuna. Ahakuba otweshelekire, watunaga, watutura entambara zaitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai rwona, waitu Mukama, oba Isheichwe; ichwe tuli ibumba, iwe ni iwe mubumbi atubumba. Ichwena tukatondwa iwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waitu Mukama, leka kunigara okashagulirana; leka kwikara oijukire entambara zaitu. Ichwena tuli bantu bawe, singa otuganyire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebigo byawe ebitakatifu byabaire marungu, Sioni nayo yabaire irungu, kandi Yerusalemu egyo ndaara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwensinga yaitu enungi entakatifu, mtuli batatenkurw'ichwe bakusingilizaga, eyokiibwe omuliro, hona mtuli twagonzaga, matongo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waitu Mukama, ebi byona tibina kyobilikukukoraho? Noija kwesiza, kutubonabonyia kugoba aha kanya?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
